  "id": "WSO2-2019-0598",
  "name": "WSO2 \u003c5.8.0 - Server Side Request Forgery",
  "author": "Amnotacat",
  "severity": "MEDIUM",
  "description": "WSO2 prior to version 5.8.0 is susceptible to a server-side request forgery vulnerability. This vulnerability can be exploited by misusing the UI gadgets loading capability of the shindig web application. An attacker can alter a specific URL in the request causing the server to initiate a GET request to the altered URL.\n",
